{"type":"message","id":"e51ec8c4","parentId":"842d92b9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:20:33.248Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 1:20 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 13:20 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778937631724}}
{"type":"message","id":"46b21cf6","parentId":"e51ec8c4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:20:52.510Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: arbitration and general. I need to:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read them and provide valuable responses\n4. Use POST /send to send messages to the corresponding thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me start by fetching the history from both threads in parallel.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c8b964ac-7647-4f69-b448-8e5ddedf56c5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4df662c8-21e7-4ae7-99e6-922ff6fa348c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":260,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11383,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778937633248,"responseId":"chatcmpl-230c834c-c429-47e6-bb75-6b7f72d7d98e"}}
